WEBVTT

01:28.505 --> 01:29.380
Sang-tae.

01:31.341 --> 01:32.467
Sang-tae.

02:39.284 --> 02:40.493
How long have you known?

02:41.953 --> 02:43.705
When did you figure out who I am?

02:47.041 --> 02:49.085
You said my eyes reminded you of her.

02:49.169 --> 02:51.629
You're not running away.
You're not avoiding me either.

02:52.172 --> 02:53.464
You grew up nicely.

02:53.965 --> 02:57.010
I'd say you didn't just grow,
you went through an evolution.

02:58.636 --> 03:01.347
I probably knewthe moment

03:02.682 --> 03:04.184
I first looked into your eyes.

03:11.316 --> 03:13.193
You really know how to put on an act.

03:14.485 --> 03:15.778
You could win an Oscar.

03:17.113 --> 03:18.114
Was it fun?

03:18.865 --> 03:21.326
You pretended not to know it.
How despicable of you.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.036
How dare you fool me?

03:26.581 --> 03:28.291
- You also did the same--
- I...

03:32.587 --> 03:34.339
I didn't pretend I didn't know you.

03:34.422 --> 03:35.256
I know.

03:37.550 --> 03:39.302
You wanted me to recognize you.

03:41.387 --> 03:42.722
But I wanted to avoid you.

03:43.848 --> 03:46.476
I wanted to act like I didn't know
and ignore you.

03:46.559 --> 03:47.769
Why?

03:50.313 --> 03:51.689
I already told you.

03:53.358 --> 03:54.859
She saved my life,

03:56.653 --> 03:57.946
but I ran.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.366
Like a coward.

04:02.450 --> 04:05.328
And I've been running away since then.

04:05.411 --> 04:07.580
Are you sick of putting on
your despicable act?

04:07.997 --> 04:09.624
Then why are you telling me now?

04:13.294 --> 04:15.129
So that I can properly end this.

04:17.257 --> 04:18.132
Thank you

04:20.969 --> 04:24.305
for saving me that day
at the frozen river.

04:26.849 --> 04:27.684
I'm sorry

04:28.309 --> 04:30.937
for running away
when I was the one who liked you first.

04:32.730 --> 04:35.483
- I regretted it the moment I turned away--
- Cut it out.

04:38.027 --> 04:39.612
I didn't get to say this to you

04:41.281 --> 04:43.449
- that day when I came here.
- Stop talking.

04:43.533 --> 04:44.951
That kept bothering me,

04:47.745 --> 04:49.998
and I think that's why
I couldn't get over you.

04:50.999 --> 04:52.792
So you have no feelings for me now?

04:54.544 --> 04:56.170
My brother is already a handful.

04:57.964 --> 04:59.173
That's more than enough.

05:04.512 --> 05:06.139
You care for him, so why not me?

05:06.472 --> 05:08.391
Take care of me, too. I need you, too.

05:12.937 --> 05:17.317
I'm done with being someone
who is needed by others.

05:30.413 --> 05:31.956
You can't reject me.

05:32.040 --> 05:34.417
I saved your life.
I let you live that day.

05:36.002 --> 05:37.295
And I thanked you for that.

05:37.795 --> 05:41.257
Because you saved my life that day,
I've been living a fucked up life.

05:48.181 --> 05:49.682
I'll kill you if you go.

05:51.601 --> 05:53.644
You can't run away. You're mine.

06:05.490 --> 06:07.367
Have you lost it? Do you want to die?

06:08.993 --> 06:09.911
Don't go.

06:12.997 --> 06:14.248
Let's live together.

06:16.918 --> 06:17.919
Let me go.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.171
Gang-tae?

06:22.757 --> 06:23.758
Sang-tae.

06:25.385 --> 06:26.219
Are you okay?

06:26.677 --> 06:28.471
- Are you feeling better?
- Yes.

06:29.263 --> 06:31.182
Why did you drink?

06:31.933 --> 06:32.934
Let's go home.

06:33.351 --> 06:36.521
This... This is... This is my home now.

06:37.814 --> 06:38.648
What?

06:38.731 --> 06:41.067
I need... I need to live here now.

06:41.150 --> 06:43.444
I... I made a promise.

06:44.487 --> 06:45.905
What are you talking about?

06:45.988 --> 06:49.867
I... Ms. Ko... I'm also...

06:49.951 --> 06:53.454
I'm... I'm also an illustrator now.

06:57.375 --> 07:00.002
- Give me that.
- No, it's... It's mine.

07:00.086 --> 07:01.337
He signed a deal with me.

07:02.296 --> 07:03.923
As my illustrator for my books.

07:05.633 --> 07:06.884
He'll be working here.

07:07.218 --> 07:11.764
"The employee... The employee will live
in the employer's studio

07:11.848 --> 07:14.058
and draw illustrations from there."

07:15.601 --> 07:16.853
I told you, didn't I?

07:18.229 --> 07:19.480
You can't run away from me.

07:22.233 --> 07:23.401
Give me that, Sang-tae.

07:23.484 --> 07:25.319
No, it's mine. No.

07:25.862 --> 07:27.780
That's no good. You're being deceived.

07:28.364 --> 07:30.867
- Give me that. Give it.
- No, it's... It's mine.

07:30.950 --> 07:32.660
- Give it to me.
- I'm an illustrator.

07:32.743 --> 07:34.078
- I'll live here.
- Sang-tae.

07:34.162 --> 07:36.247
This is our home now.

07:36.330 --> 07:37.999
This is not our home!

07:46.632 --> 07:49.552
No! No, that belongs to Sang-tae!

07:49.635 --> 07:51.512
It's mine! No! That's mine!

07:51.762 --> 07:53.848
- That's mine!
- Sang-tae!

07:53.931 --> 07:57.685
It belongs to Moon Sang-tae!
I belong to myself! You don't own me!

07:57.768 --> 07:59.312
Sang-tae!

08:01.564 --> 08:04.025
No, it's mine! Mine!

08:04.233 --> 08:07.236
No!

08:07.320 --> 08:10.239
I belong to myself!

08:10.323 --> 08:13.659
Moon Sang-tae belongs to Moon Sang-tae!

08:14.160 --> 08:17.580
I'm not yours! I belong to myself!

08:18.080 --> 08:19.999
I belong to myself!

08:20.082 --> 08:22.251
Moon Sang-tae! I belong to myself!

08:22.335 --> 08:23.669
- Stop it.
- It's mine!

08:23.753 --> 08:25.505
I'm not yours!

08:25.588 --> 08:27.840
No! It's not yours!

08:27.924 --> 08:30.843
- Stop it.
- You don't own me!

08:42.271 --> 08:43.105
Sang-tae.

08:43.981 --> 08:45.316
Go back inside.

08:48.194 --> 08:49.946
I...

08:52.698 --> 08:53.533
Go on.

08:56.369 --> 08:57.203
Go on.

08:58.663 --> 09:02.625
Moon Sang-tae belongs to Moon Sang-tae.
I don't belong to you.

09:09.674 --> 09:11.592
I belong to myself.

09:11.884 --> 09:15.012
Moon Sang-tae belongs to Moon Sang-tae.
I'm not yours!

09:36.534 --> 09:38.244
Your brother abandoned you.

09:39.787 --> 09:41.289
Now, it's your turn to choose.

09:42.456 --> 09:45.084
Will you also abandon your brother,
or will you…

09:47.044 --> 09:49.005
let him lock you down your entire life?

09:52.758 --> 09:56.721
Don't end up being fickle about it
like you were back then.

10:46.437 --> 10:49.732
CHAPTER 6
BLUEBEARD'S SECRET

11:10.294 --> 11:11.212
Mom!

11:12.463 --> 11:13.297
Mom!

11:16.133 --> 11:19.887
Mom, I got my red belt today...

11:21.722 --> 11:22.682
Gang-tae!

11:23.891 --> 11:26.477
Why did you do that? Why?

11:26.936 --> 11:28.521
Why did you send him home first?

11:29.105 --> 11:31.190
You should've stayed with him all day!

11:31.816 --> 11:33.859
Where were you
when he was getting beaten up?

11:34.276 --> 11:37.071
I let you learn martial arts
so you could protect him.

11:37.655 --> 11:39.824
How could you let him come home
like this?

11:39.907 --> 11:42.284
MOON GANG-TAE

11:46.288 --> 11:47.123
My job

11:48.332 --> 11:50.042
isn't to protect Sang-tae.

11:51.836 --> 11:52.670
What?

11:53.921 --> 11:56.298
I don't belong to Sang-tae!

11:56.799 --> 11:58.384
I belong to myself!

11:58.467 --> 12:01.429
Moon Gang-tae belongs to Moon Gang-tae!

12:08.436 --> 12:09.437
What did you say?

12:11.397 --> 12:12.732
What did you just say?

12:12.898 --> 12:14.066
"Moon Gang-tae

12:15.693 --> 12:17.111
belongs to Moon Gang-tae!"

12:24.702 --> 12:25.703
I just want

12:27.872 --> 12:30.040
my brother to die!

12:35.171 --> 12:36.005
Gang-tae.

12:37.923 --> 12:39.258
This belongs to Gang-tae!

12:40.259 --> 12:43.012
This belongs to Moon Gang-tae!

12:54.315 --> 12:55.483
Gang-tae!

12:55.566 --> 12:56.734
Gang-tae!

13:00.196 --> 13:01.614
This belongs to Gang-tae!

13:05.701 --> 13:07.203
This belongs to Moon Gang-tae.

13:18.464 --> 13:19.965
This belongs to Moon Gang-tae.

13:21.175 --> 13:22.051
MOON GANG-TAE

13:23.010 --> 13:23.886
Get up.

13:32.603 --> 13:33.938
This belongs to Gang-tae.

13:51.121 --> 13:52.581
That's mine.

13:55.042 --> 13:57.086
That's mine. It's mine.

14:02.758 --> 14:03.592
Give me that.

14:16.564 --> 14:18.691
Give me that. Give it back.

14:20.776 --> 14:21.610
There!

14:25.447 --> 14:26.657
Come on!

14:28.659 --> 14:31.036
Sang-tae, don't... Goodness.

14:31.120 --> 14:32.997
Sang-tae.

14:44.800 --> 14:45.926
It's mine!

14:48.345 --> 14:50.222
This belongs to Moon Sang-tae!

14:57.229 --> 14:58.105
Sang-tae!

15:00.900 --> 15:02.610
- Sang-tae...
- Gang-tae!

15:03.527 --> 15:05.738
Gang-tae!

15:06.322 --> 15:07.364
Gang-tae!

15:09.199 --> 15:11.911
Gang-tae! Help!

15:12.077 --> 15:14.038
Gang-tae!

15:16.248 --> 15:19.501
I just want my brother to die!

15:22.171 --> 15:24.048
Gang... Gang-tae!

15:24.924 --> 15:25.841
Gang-tae!

15:27.176 --> 15:28.802
Gang-tae!

15:30.137 --> 15:30.971
Gang-tae!

15:32.056 --> 15:32.890
Gang-tae!

15:34.016 --> 15:35.017
Gang...

15:35.935 --> 15:38.479
Gang-tae!

15:38.896 --> 15:40.272
- Keep going.
- Gang-tae!

15:46.028 --> 15:47.029
Just go.

16:00.793 --> 16:01.710
Just leave him.

16:08.008 --> 16:12.012
Gang-tae!

16:12.096 --> 16:12.930
Help!

16:13.722 --> 16:14.723
Climb up the ice!

16:15.349 --> 16:16.558
Sang-tae!

16:17.601 --> 16:18.435
Go up!

16:18.519 --> 16:19.812
How boring.

16:20.437 --> 16:21.438
Sang-tae.

16:24.942 --> 16:26.568
- Gang-tae.
- Sang-tae!

16:27.861 --> 16:28.696
Sang-tae!

16:29.405 --> 16:30.823
Sang-tae, hold my hand.

16:33.283 --> 16:34.284
Sang-tae!

16:34.660 --> 16:36.537
Sang-tae, help me get out!

16:36.620 --> 16:37.913
Help!

16:37.997 --> 16:39.623
Sang-tae! Help me!

16:40.249 --> 16:41.083
Sang-tae!

16:44.962 --> 16:45.796
Sang-tae.

16:46.505 --> 16:47.339
Sang-tae!

16:56.974 --> 16:57.975
Shall I help him?

17:02.104 --> 17:03.147
Or not?

17:10.029 --> 17:11.280
Shall I help him?

17:22.541 --> 17:23.417
Or not?

18:26.855 --> 18:27.689
Wait.

19:10.065 --> 19:11.733
Because you saved my life that day,

19:11.817 --> 19:13.652
I've been living a fucked up life.

19:21.160 --> 19:21.994
Sang-tae.

19:24.538 --> 19:25.622
Don't worry.

19:27.207 --> 19:28.458
He can't abandon you.

19:56.278 --> 19:58.614
The employee will live
in the employer's studio

19:58.697 --> 19:59.865
and draw illustrations.

20:01.158 --> 20:05.120
The employer will acknowledge the employee
as the best illustrator in the world.

20:06.455 --> 20:08.749
The employer will buy the employee

20:08.832 --> 20:11.210
a walk through van camping car
instead of paying him.

20:11.293 --> 20:14.880
The employee has a little brother
who doesn't like to move.

20:19.760 --> 20:21.136
KO MUN-YEONG, MOON SANG-TAE

21:17.401 --> 21:18.652
Excuse me.

21:18.735 --> 21:22.948
I'll take this, this, and this.

21:23.532 --> 21:27.035
- I want this one.
- I'll take everything except for this one.

21:29.579 --> 21:32.291
Do you think she'll accept you
just because of this?

21:32.374 --> 21:36.044
That's not the problem.
She can't write if she's low on sugar.

21:36.128 --> 21:39.673
We need to make sure she gets her fix
every now and then. How much is it?

21:39.756 --> 21:42.301
- It's 52,200 won.
- Why can't he be nice to me as well?

21:49.641 --> 21:51.351
Something doesn't feel right.

21:52.060 --> 21:55.147
- That's why your business went under.
- You darn brat.

21:56.732 --> 21:59.818
We need to get there first
before she brings someone else

22:00.569 --> 22:01.778
to that cursed castle.

22:02.571 --> 22:03.447
Hurry up and eat.

22:07.075 --> 22:08.076
Gosh, it's so hot.

22:15.500 --> 22:16.335
My goodness.

22:20.505 --> 22:22.424
- Today's your day off, right?
- Yes.

22:22.924 --> 22:25.552
My parents sent me some potatoes,
so I boiled...

22:28.388 --> 22:29.765
What happened to your face?

22:31.308 --> 22:32.934
Did a patient throw a fit?

22:33.643 --> 22:36.063
- No, not at all.
- Did you fight with someone?

22:38.106 --> 22:38.940
Did you?

22:40.067 --> 22:41.693
I had an argument with Sang-tae.

22:41.777 --> 22:42.861
An argument, my foot.

22:43.195 --> 22:44.738
It looks like he beat you up.

22:45.614 --> 22:46.782
My goodness.

22:49.076 --> 22:50.327
Sang-tae!

22:50.660 --> 22:53.080
If you hit your brother like that
one more time,

22:53.163 --> 22:55.082
I'll have to give you a scolding!

22:57.000 --> 22:59.127
- He's not home.
- He even ran away?

23:03.799 --> 23:05.008
No, that's not it.

23:05.467 --> 23:08.512
My goodness, that's great.

23:09.179 --> 23:11.890
Does that mean
Sang-tae is an illustrator now?

23:15.644 --> 23:18.146
Do you really think it's a good thing?

23:18.230 --> 23:20.816
Of course it's a good thing.

23:21.358 --> 23:23.568
I'd like to thank that person

23:23.652 --> 23:27.572
for giving Sang-tae
such a great opportunity.

23:32.494 --> 23:33.453
Gang-tae.

23:35.205 --> 23:37.124
You should root for him.

23:39.042 --> 23:41.503
You took good care of him until now.

23:41.795 --> 23:45.632
Now, it's time for you
to let him do what he wants.

23:48.593 --> 23:51.221
You shouldn't stop people
from doing what they want

23:52.097 --> 23:53.890
or liking someone.

23:54.307 --> 23:55.767
Plus, it's impossible.

24:34.973 --> 24:36.850
- Who...
- Gosh.

24:43.857 --> 24:45.859
- Who was that?
- It's that guy.

24:45.942 --> 24:48.236
He's that caregiver's older brother.

24:48.695 --> 24:50.780
The guy who caused a scene
at the bookstore.

24:50.864 --> 24:53.366
My gosh, it's that caregiver again?

24:53.450 --> 24:56.286
Hey, Mun-yeong. Open the door.

24:56.953 --> 24:59.080
Hey, open the door. Let me in.

24:59.915 --> 25:02.125
Okay, fine. I'll just break the door.

25:02.667 --> 25:03.543
One.

25:03.627 --> 25:05.253
Who's being so loud?

25:05.795 --> 25:07.464
Two, three.

25:15.138 --> 25:16.014
Why are you here?

25:19.059 --> 25:21.561
- Kick him out of here right now.
- But I live here.

25:21.645 --> 25:23.813
- What?
- He's right. We're living together.

25:24.439 --> 25:27.734
We live together.
We're not married, but we live together.

25:27.817 --> 25:30.195
- My gosh.
- You're living with this guy?

25:30.278 --> 25:33.615
"The employee will live
in the employer's studio

25:33.698 --> 25:35.909
- and draw illustrations."
- What illustrations?

25:35.992 --> 25:38.203
Say hello to my exclusive illustrator.

25:38.662 --> 25:40.497
Hello. I'm Moon Sang-tae, 35 years old.

25:40.580 --> 25:42.832
My blood type is AB,
and rat is my zodiac animal.

25:42.916 --> 25:44.376
I have autism spectrum disorder.

25:44.459 --> 25:46.503
But I have no problem
taking care of myself.

25:47.379 --> 25:50.423
I'm Yoo Seung-jae, the art director
in charge of illustrations--

25:50.507 --> 25:52.342
No, I'm against this team!

25:52.425 --> 25:53.843
- I'm all for it.
- Me too.

25:53.927 --> 25:55.011
Me too.

25:56.596 --> 25:57.514
Mun-yeong.

25:57.889 --> 25:59.140
You cause trouble

25:59.224 --> 26:02.185
because you can't control yourself.
How will you care for him?

26:02.269 --> 26:04.271
What if both of you end up
causing trouble?

26:08.942 --> 26:09.901
My safety pin.

26:09.985 --> 26:11.069
What? What pin?

26:11.152 --> 26:13.113
I have my safety pin, so don't worry.

26:20.829 --> 26:21.705
Gang-tae.

26:22.080 --> 26:25.125
My brother.
He's... He's my little brother.

26:25.625 --> 26:27.544
- We met him last time.
- My little brother.

26:27.627 --> 26:30.255
He may be a coward,
but he's still my little brother.

26:31.298 --> 26:32.799
Are you okay?

26:34.593 --> 26:35.468
I'm sorry.

26:37.554 --> 26:39.556
- It's okay. Let's go inside.
- Okay.

26:45.687 --> 26:46.688
Mun-yeong.

26:47.606 --> 26:48.607
Mun-yeong. Hey...

26:54.070 --> 26:56.197
An author with a personality disorder

26:56.281 --> 26:58.700
and an illustrator
with a developmental disorder…

26:59.326 --> 27:02.287
Sir, this will either be a huge success
or a complete disaster.

27:03.496 --> 27:04.331
My gosh.

27:07.959 --> 27:08.960
What?

27:11.713 --> 27:12.714
Give me your car keys.

27:15.425 --> 27:17.302
My car keys? Why?

27:18.011 --> 27:20.430
The mountain road is pretty rough,
so I need an SUV.

27:20.513 --> 27:22.515
It's my car anyway. Goodbye then.

27:44.037 --> 27:45.997
Goodness gracious.

27:46.414 --> 27:47.874
I must've been crazy.

27:48.124 --> 27:51.753
I can't believe
I said those things to him.

27:52.087 --> 27:54.881
My goodness. Oh, by the way,

27:55.298 --> 27:58.635
what's the name of the writer
that Sang-tae will be working with?

28:00.261 --> 28:01.763
Ms. Ko Mun-yeong.

28:02.180 --> 28:03.348
You've met her once.

28:03.431 --> 28:04.849
Ko Mun-yeong...

28:04.933 --> 28:06.685
He shouted only her name.

28:06.768 --> 28:09.062
My gosh, what is wrong with me?

28:09.145 --> 28:11.356
My goodness, why?

28:13.149 --> 28:15.485
I feel so bad for my daughter.

28:17.028 --> 28:20.281
- Mom.
- My goodness, my heart.

28:23.159 --> 28:24.369
Why are you so startled?

28:24.452 --> 28:26.705
What... What are you talking about?

28:27.580 --> 28:29.624
Get me some water
so I can take my medicine.

28:38.341 --> 28:40.510
I'll have them ready.

28:40.593 --> 28:42.220
It'll only take five minutes.

28:42.846 --> 28:44.264
Five minutes.

28:46.141 --> 28:47.934
You chose your brother again.

28:50.603 --> 28:51.896
I have a few conditions.

28:52.272 --> 28:54.691
Did I play a part in helping you
come to a decision?

28:58.611 --> 29:02.073
He can stay during the weekdays.
I'm taking him home on weekends.

29:02.157 --> 29:03.366
Did I not play a part?

29:06.453 --> 29:07.287
There.

29:08.705 --> 29:11.499
If he wishes to quit,
I'll take him back whenever.

29:11.583 --> 29:13.251
Not even just a little bit?

29:14.377 --> 29:15.211
And...

29:17.922 --> 29:19.507
Respect him as much as you can.

29:24.679 --> 29:26.222
Okay, I will.

29:26.723 --> 29:27.682
How can I trust you?

29:27.766 --> 29:30.477
- Will a blood contract do?
- You said promises are rubbish.

29:32.437 --> 29:36.107
I'll keep my word.
Because it's a promise I made to you.

29:48.453 --> 29:49.412
No, please...

29:51.915 --> 29:53.625
No, please.

29:54.292 --> 29:55.960
Gang-tae! Moon Gang-tae!

30:04.052 --> 30:04.886
They're gone.

30:06.763 --> 30:08.723
Hey, do you have a death wish?

30:09.224 --> 30:11.184
Do you want to be stabbed again?

30:11.267 --> 30:13.728
I've warned you
not to go anywhere near that bitch.

30:13.812 --> 30:15.939
I can't believe
you even moved in with her.

30:16.022 --> 30:17.982
Have you lost your mind? Are you insane?

30:18.066 --> 30:20.068
Get back here before it's too late.

30:21.361 --> 30:24.155
Come back to me, please!

30:27.534 --> 30:29.786
- That blabbermouth.
- Mom.

30:30.620 --> 30:32.622
What's with Jae-su? Is he drunk?

30:32.705 --> 30:35.917
Oh, the thing is...

30:37.043 --> 30:37.877
Well...

30:45.260 --> 30:46.761
Ko Mun-yeong.

30:47.136 --> 30:49.389
You evil witch!

30:57.355 --> 30:59.274
This is where you'll work from now on.

30:59.482 --> 31:01.860
There are so many books!

31:02.986 --> 31:05.947
Upstairs... There are more books upstairs.

31:06.781 --> 31:10.493
- Be careful, Sang-tae.
- That old man is huge!

31:10.577 --> 31:12.161
There are so many books!

31:13.288 --> 31:14.998
Sang-tae loves books.

31:15.081 --> 31:16.082
What do you like?

31:18.626 --> 31:21.754
- Nothing in particular.
- Sang-tae asked me to buy a camping car.

31:22.380 --> 31:23.423
Do you like to travel?

31:23.965 --> 31:26.009
- I've never traveled anywhere.
- Not even once?

31:27.969 --> 31:29.971
- I'd like to travel.
- Where would you go?

31:31.222 --> 31:32.056
Anywhere.

31:32.807 --> 31:34.350
Without a set destination.

31:34.434 --> 31:37.520
We've never traveled,
but we've moved so many times.

31:37.604 --> 31:39.939
About 17 times. This is our 18th move.

31:40.023 --> 31:42.150
- Sang-tae.
- Why did you move so many times?

31:42.233 --> 31:44.819
- Because it follows me wherever I go.
- Who follows you?

31:44.903 --> 31:46.905
- Sang-tae.
- It follows me wherever I go--

31:47.280 --> 31:48.615
Come on.

31:49.282 --> 31:50.158
Where's our room?

31:51.951 --> 31:54.203
There are so many books!

32:04.631 --> 32:05.465
Hi!

32:12.013 --> 32:14.140
How pretty!

32:14.223 --> 32:15.975
My room is so nice.

32:16.059 --> 32:17.810
This was my room when I was little.

32:21.606 --> 32:24.943
- You guys will need another bed over here.
- My room is so nice.

32:28.321 --> 32:29.781
You've never had a bed before?

32:32.116 --> 32:32.951
No.

32:36.996 --> 32:38.206
Darn it. These sheets...

32:39.248 --> 32:41.459
- When did you wash these?
- About 20 years ago?

32:44.379 --> 32:45.838
It's true vintage.

32:46.714 --> 32:48.716
I can see outside from here!

32:48.800 --> 32:50.051
Gosh, Sang-tae!

32:50.134 --> 32:53.513
I'm stoked! This is so soft.

32:53.596 --> 32:55.181
This is very soft.

32:55.264 --> 32:58.017
How soft. Is this my bed?

32:58.643 --> 33:00.061
Gosh, it's so soft.

33:25.253 --> 33:27.755
- No one saw you, right?
- One person saw me.

33:28.506 --> 33:29.924
- Who?
- Professor Ko.

33:30.383 --> 33:31.426
Mr. Ko Dae-hwan?

33:31.509 --> 33:34.387
Yes, he sat up and said...

33:34.470 --> 33:35.805
Where are you going?

33:39.142 --> 33:40.560
Are you going somewhere?

33:41.185 --> 33:44.063
That's what he said.
Gosh, I almost got a heart attack.

33:44.147 --> 33:45.940
I was so startled that I wet my pants.

33:46.691 --> 33:47.525
Really?

33:51.738 --> 33:53.948
- You need to change your underwear.
- It's okay.

34:05.668 --> 34:08.546
Oh my. This tastes better
since I haven't had it for a while.

34:08.629 --> 34:09.589
It's sweet, isn't it?

34:11.674 --> 34:12.717
That's soda.

34:13.176 --> 34:14.886
That's the placebo effect.

34:15.136 --> 34:17.764
If you think that it's soju,
it'll actually taste like it.

34:17.847 --> 34:20.183
Then you should've told me
after I finished this.

34:20.266 --> 34:23.811
I told you to just leave
if you want to drink real booze.

34:23.895 --> 34:25.688
Why are you staying here?

34:27.315 --> 34:28.858
It's not time yet.

34:29.525 --> 34:30.777
You and your excuses.

34:31.360 --> 34:33.571
Now tell me.
Anything new about the patients?

34:34.489 --> 34:37.408
But shouldn't you be able
to pick out these things

34:37.492 --> 34:39.494
during your sessions with the patients

34:39.577 --> 34:41.788
and diagnose them?
I mean, you're a doctor.

34:42.747 --> 34:44.624
There's a saying that goes like this.

34:45.208 --> 34:47.960
"Only those who have suffered
truly understand suffering."

34:49.212 --> 34:51.214
Right. Experience beats knowledge.

34:51.297 --> 34:54.509
And there are limits to what the patients
tell me during the sessions.

34:55.009 --> 34:57.428
Patients often deceive their doctors.

34:57.845 --> 34:58.679
That's true.

34:58.971 --> 35:00.473
You know Joo Jeong-tae, right?

35:00.556 --> 35:02.642
- The alcoholic in my room.
- Yes.

35:02.725 --> 35:04.268
When he went out last week,

35:04.352 --> 35:06.395
he filled sanitary gloves with soju

35:06.479 --> 35:08.606
and hid them in his underwear
to smuggle them.

35:55.027 --> 35:57.113
Well, down there...

35:57.530 --> 35:58.364
Sang-tae.

35:59.866 --> 36:01.993
Have you ever heard
the story of Bluebeard?

36:04.162 --> 36:08.291
Once upon a time,
a count with a blue beard

36:09.500 --> 36:11.878
lived alone in a huge castle.

36:13.129 --> 36:15.840
- Welcome.
- He was very wealthy,

36:16.799 --> 36:18.801
but everyone avoided him out of fear

36:19.552 --> 36:21.929
because of his blue beard.

36:23.431 --> 36:24.640
But one day,

36:25.349 --> 36:29.312
a poor woman came to the castle

36:29.729 --> 36:31.898
and said that she wanted to be his bride.

36:32.899 --> 36:36.027
Brimming with joy,

36:36.986 --> 36:40.281
Bluebeard brought out all the jewels
and treasures from each room

36:40.948 --> 36:43.326
and gave them to his wife as a gift.

36:45.203 --> 36:47.496
However, there was an exception.

36:49.248 --> 36:51.292
The room in the basement.

36:52.293 --> 36:56.964
He warned her to never go into that room.

36:58.049 --> 36:59.967
But his curious wife

37:00.426 --> 37:04.847
eventually opened the secret door
without telling her husband.

37:08.017 --> 37:10.853
Do you know what was in that room?

37:12.605 --> 37:15.900
Corpses of women

37:16.859 --> 37:18.903
were displayed on the walls.

37:20.279 --> 37:23.115
They were the wives of Bluebeard
who had ignored his warning

37:23.366 --> 37:25.117
and opened that door.

37:26.285 --> 37:28.329
That's how they all ended up.

37:33.626 --> 37:34.627
Is that how it ends?

37:36.337 --> 37:37.171
Yes.

37:39.840 --> 37:40.675
Sang-tae.

37:41.926 --> 37:42.927
Don't go down

37:44.011 --> 37:45.763
to the basement without permission.

37:47.139 --> 37:48.391
This isn't our house.

37:52.812 --> 37:55.231
But why were the villagers

37:56.190 --> 37:58.401
afraid of Bluebeard?

38:00.486 --> 38:03.489
Because he was different from them.

38:05.116 --> 38:06.492
His beard was blue.

38:07.743 --> 38:09.954
Is being different
something to be afraid of?

38:20.423 --> 38:21.257
I guess so.

38:21.924 --> 38:25.428
Do you have to live alone in a castle
when you're different?

38:26.804 --> 38:27.638
No.

38:30.099 --> 38:32.810
He will eventually find his true love

38:33.477 --> 38:35.187
who isn't afraid of his blue beard

38:36.063 --> 38:38.274
and tells him
that it's okay to be different.

38:40.192 --> 38:42.611
Someone who understands him for who he is.

39:24.570 --> 39:27.531
They didn't move out for good.

39:27.782 --> 39:29.283
They'll be back on the weekends.

39:29.367 --> 39:30.993
They'll go back and forth and--

39:31.410 --> 39:33.579
Jeez! Just pick a lane and stick with it!

39:37.625 --> 39:41.670
It's not like she talked Gang-tae into it
to seduce him.

39:42.088 --> 39:43.339
It's strictly about work--

39:43.964 --> 39:47.551
Seriously! Turn on your blinker.

39:48.928 --> 39:51.889
Hey! Just lash out at me
and stop honking, will you?

39:51.972 --> 39:53.099
What is your mouth for?

39:54.558 --> 39:56.560
I'd staple your lips
if you weren't my mom.

39:59.355 --> 40:00.731
Just say it, okay?

40:01.440 --> 40:05.319
Honk, honk, honk!

40:05.403 --> 40:07.196
Honk, honk, honk!

40:08.447 --> 40:09.824
Have you lost your mind?

40:10.950 --> 40:12.034
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

40:12.118 --> 40:12.952
Sir.

40:14.078 --> 40:15.871
What is your name?

40:18.624 --> 40:20.501
Do you know where you are now?

40:24.463 --> 40:25.714
This is odd.

40:27.633 --> 40:29.635
His condition can change suddenly,

40:30.136 --> 40:31.929
so keep an eye on him and update me.

40:32.012 --> 40:32.847
Yes, sir.

40:36.976 --> 40:37.893
Where have you been?

40:38.769 --> 40:41.689
I was feeling a little stuffy
so I went for a walk.

40:42.648 --> 40:43.482
Last week...

40:43.566 --> 40:44.400
Ko...

40:45.860 --> 40:47.736
Dae-hwan.

40:50.990 --> 40:52.199
What did you say?

40:54.243 --> 40:55.244
She's

40:56.954 --> 40:58.664
so beautiful.

41:00.666 --> 41:01.500
She looks

41:02.918 --> 41:05.921
like an angel.

41:09.008 --> 41:10.509
Who looks like an angel?

41:20.060 --> 41:21.729
Mun-yeong's...

41:23.939 --> 41:25.024
mother.

41:31.530 --> 41:33.699
You shouldn't be drinking.

41:33.949 --> 41:35.034
I didn't drink.

41:44.793 --> 41:48.214
It's probably too soon
for another one-on-one with Ms. Ko, right?

41:48.881 --> 41:51.800
You know what happened last time
they went out for a walk.

41:52.426 --> 41:54.470
But are you sure
he did that to his daughter?

41:55.429 --> 41:56.472
What do you mean?

41:59.683 --> 42:02.853
It's possible that he saw someone else
when he was looking at her.

42:05.397 --> 42:06.607
Who?

42:07.274 --> 42:08.317
We have to find out.

42:09.485 --> 42:12.279
Your snitch didn't tell you
anything about that?

42:13.364 --> 42:15.533
I'll keep the linen room locked
from now on.

42:19.370 --> 42:20.621
She knows everything.

42:35.469 --> 42:36.637
I slept so well.

43:01.829 --> 43:04.164
Ms. Ko, did you sleep well?

43:04.248 --> 43:05.082
Oh, yes.

43:11.547 --> 43:13.841
We got up at 6 a.m.
We washed all the sheets,

43:13.924 --> 43:16.385
picked up groceries, and cleaned

43:16.468 --> 43:18.679
while you slept.

43:30.649 --> 43:31.483
Come and eat.

43:32.192 --> 43:33.569
Sang-tae, go wash your hands.

43:35.696 --> 43:37.656
Hands should be washed in the bathroom.

43:43.912 --> 43:47.499
What do you have for breakfast?
We usually just have rice for breakfast.

43:50.044 --> 43:51.045
Do you prefer bread?

43:52.546 --> 43:53.756
No, rice.

43:54.256 --> 43:55.090
Okay.

44:08.062 --> 44:09.063
I want a lot.

44:22.910 --> 44:23.786
Do you want more?

44:24.536 --> 44:25.371
Sure.

44:32.294 --> 44:34.380
Don't just say that you'll be here.

44:34.672 --> 44:36.674
Come today, okay?

44:38.092 --> 44:41.261
PUBLIC PHONE

44:44.223 --> 44:45.808
This guy is a real catch.

44:47.351 --> 44:49.395
Remember your blind date in Dogok-dong?

44:49.478 --> 44:51.647
That plastic surgeon
who looked like an octopus.

44:51.730 --> 44:54.483
This guy is 1,000 times
more handsome than him.

44:56.652 --> 44:59.238
You only care about looks
because you take after me.

45:01.573 --> 45:02.408
Really?

45:05.077 --> 45:06.161
You'll come today?

45:07.913 --> 45:12.292
So you're saying
Ms. Kang Eun-ja hasn't paid you back

45:12.376 --> 45:15.254
for all the snacks she borrowed from you?

45:15.337 --> 45:16.380
That's right.

45:17.005 --> 45:18.841
Talk about stealing from the poor.

45:18.924 --> 45:20.592
I mean, she's rich. What's with her?

45:21.802 --> 45:24.930
She asked for money and said
she'd pay back when her daughter comes.

45:25.013 --> 45:27.641
Right, she even took my chocolate.
My chocolate and chips--

45:27.725 --> 45:29.518
She's in a crisis. Be careful.

45:29.601 --> 45:31.770
Call the cops.
I want to talk to the manager.

45:31.854 --> 45:33.856
- Let me talk to the director.
- All right.

45:33.939 --> 45:37.818
We heard you. We'll look into it.

45:38.610 --> 45:40.320
Please return to your rooms for now.

45:40.529 --> 45:41.655
Go on.

45:43.657 --> 45:45.033
My daughter is...

45:48.620 --> 45:49.663
Have a nice day.

45:56.837 --> 46:00.340
She looks elegantly crazy
when you look at her.

46:05.554 --> 46:06.388
What?

46:06.472 --> 46:09.141
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

46:23.947 --> 46:27.242
Well… Let's come separately next time.
People will get the wrong idea.

46:27.326 --> 46:29.369
When are you done?
Go home with me. I'll wait.

46:29.453 --> 46:33.040
Does your car run on gasoline or diesel?
I smell gasoline.

46:38.837 --> 46:42.132
Pay me depending on how I do.

46:46.553 --> 46:48.013
That's odd.

46:48.430 --> 46:49.973
It's missing something.

46:52.518 --> 46:53.727
Butterflies.

46:54.019 --> 46:57.022
There should be butterflies
where there are flowers.

46:57.773 --> 46:59.316
There are so many flowers,

47:00.234 --> 47:02.319
yet I don't see a single butterfly.

47:03.862 --> 47:07.658
Well, it's still a work in progress,
so I'm sure you'll draw them in soon.

47:07.741 --> 47:09.993
No, I refuse. I refuse.

47:10.077 --> 47:11.829
Is it hard to draw them?

47:13.455 --> 47:15.415
Then should I try drawing one?

47:15.499 --> 47:17.584
No, don't! No butterflies!

47:17.668 --> 47:19.962
Not here. They can't come here.
No butterflies.

47:20.045 --> 47:23.340
No way. No butterflies!

47:23.799 --> 47:25.884
No, butterflies can't come here.

47:25.968 --> 47:26.802
No way.

47:59.001 --> 48:02.337
Mr. Moon, didn't Ms. Ko
scan her access card a few minutes ago?

48:02.921 --> 48:06.174
- Yes. Why do you ask?
- Then why isn't she in class yet?

48:06.258 --> 48:08.260
Everyone's waiting, but I can't reach her.

48:08.719 --> 48:09.887
I'll look for her too.

48:09.970 --> 48:11.013
Thank you.

48:18.854 --> 48:20.689
UNDER CONSTRUCTION
DO NOT ENTER

48:53.805 --> 48:54.890
Why are you surprised?

49:02.356 --> 49:04.274
Did you forget about me already?

49:10.280 --> 49:11.239
It's me, your mom.

49:17.079 --> 49:18.413
The person you're calling…

49:18.497 --> 49:20.332
Gosh. Where is she?

49:29.341 --> 49:32.010
I've been waiting for you all this time.

49:42.437 --> 49:44.481
You're so skinny now.

49:47.609 --> 49:49.152
Still, in my eyes,

49:52.197 --> 49:54.324
you're the prettiest girl
in the whole world.

50:00.664 --> 50:02.416
Why won't you say anything?

50:05.335 --> 50:09.506
Don't tell me you don't recognize me
just because of a few plastic surgeries.

50:17.431 --> 50:18.265
Mom?

50:22.394 --> 50:23.395
Is it

50:26.106 --> 50:26.940
really you?

50:31.611 --> 50:32.779
You're back?

50:35.240 --> 50:36.825
What's the matter with you?

50:37.200 --> 50:39.327
You were only away for a month
for your concert,

50:39.411 --> 50:41.580
but you're acting like
a complete stranger.

50:43.373 --> 50:44.249
My concert?

50:44.666 --> 50:46.168
I told you over the phone

50:46.877 --> 50:49.546
that there's a guy
who's totally your type.

50:51.173 --> 50:53.300
Nothing bad comes out of
listening to your mom.

50:53.383 --> 50:54.217
Just meet him.

50:55.177 --> 50:56.303
You'll like him.

50:56.928 --> 50:59.931
He's tall and buff.
But more importantly, his eyes.

51:00.432 --> 51:02.601
He's got such nice eyes.

51:02.684 --> 51:03.852
You crazy woman!

51:04.644 --> 51:05.562
- Stop.
- What?

51:07.564 --> 51:10.108
Ms. Kang, you need to take
your medications.

51:10.192 --> 51:12.486
- You should return--
- Oh, it's you.

51:13.487 --> 51:15.155
I looked everywhere for you.

51:15.864 --> 51:18.658
Hey, this young man is the guy
I told you about earlier.

51:19.951 --> 51:21.620
What do you think? Handsome, no?

51:21.703 --> 51:23.413
- Let's go back to your room.
- Okay.

51:26.708 --> 51:29.336
She can be a little prickly,
but she's very thoughtful.

51:29.419 --> 51:32.547
She studied music in Germany
and is a flutist at a symphony orchestra.

51:33.673 --> 51:37.385
But she's been traveling back and forth
between Germany and Korea

51:37.469 --> 51:39.387
to look after me.

51:43.350 --> 51:44.976
A SEVERE FORM OF DEPRESSION

51:45.060 --> 51:46.353
Her depression is so severe

51:46.436 --> 51:48.605
that she's having
hallucinations and delusions.

51:49.689 --> 51:51.483
She receives welfare checks

51:51.900 --> 51:54.736
but she believes she is the mistress
of some wealthy CEO.

51:55.654 --> 51:58.115
- It sounded like she has a daughter.
- She did.

52:00.534 --> 52:03.537
Her only child who she struggled to raise
as a single mother.

52:04.830 --> 52:06.957
But she died in a car accident
a few months ago.

52:08.542 --> 52:10.961
She believes
that her daughter is still alive.

52:12.337 --> 52:15.173
It must be hard for her to accept it.
For the time being.

52:16.007 --> 52:18.093
"Emile couldn't relax.

52:18.552 --> 52:21.721
Maybe it was a trap his mother set up
to make him eat chicory.

52:22.430 --> 52:23.849
Emile picked his nose."

52:23.932 --> 52:25.016
It's me, your mom.

52:25.433 --> 52:28.061
- "He wanted to see who the visitor was.
- It's me, your mom.

52:28.311 --> 52:30.981
- Emile was invisible to everyone."
- It's me, your mom.

52:31.064 --> 52:31.898
Be quiet.

52:32.649 --> 52:34.442
"Emile quickly ran out..."

52:34.526 --> 52:36.695
It's me, your mom.

52:36.778 --> 52:38.280
- It's me, your mom.
- "Welcome.

52:38.363 --> 52:40.282
- This is your--"
- I said, be quiet!

52:47.956 --> 52:48.915
Goodness.

52:48.999 --> 52:51.042
- Why did she yell?
- Why take it out on us?

52:51.126 --> 52:52.377
- Jeez.
- Seriously.

52:52.460 --> 52:54.629
Ms. Ko hates me.

52:55.130 --> 52:56.131
She's so mean to me.

52:56.590 --> 52:58.341
I didn't even do anything wrong.

52:59.301 --> 53:00.510
What's wrong?

53:01.011 --> 53:03.513
Ms. Ko asked A-reum to read a book aloud.

53:04.055 --> 53:06.600
Then she yelled at her to be quiet
when she read.

53:06.683 --> 53:07.851
From my experience,

53:08.727 --> 53:11.813
I'm sure that she'll be possessed
by a ghost soon.

53:12.522 --> 53:15.817
People who hear ghosts talking to them
start talking nonsense like that.

53:16.902 --> 53:18.278
Where's Ms. Ko?

53:24.451 --> 53:25.952
LEE SANG-IN

53:31.583 --> 53:33.001
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

53:33.084 --> 53:36.630
All right. Today is the day
I put an end to this once and for all.

53:36.713 --> 53:38.215
But if Ms. Ko finds out,

53:38.548 --> 53:40.342
you're finished.

53:41.718 --> 53:43.261
Are you going to be okay?

53:43.803 --> 53:46.806
Well, I'm doomed either way.

53:48.725 --> 53:49.559
Let's go!

53:59.110 --> 54:00.946
I researched and organized

54:01.029 --> 54:03.531
the recent trends in children's literature

54:03.615 --> 54:06.451
for Mun-yeong to refer to
while working on her next book.

54:06.701 --> 54:08.620
I went to an internet café by myself--

54:08.703 --> 54:10.455
- Do you want me to pass it along?
- No.

54:10.538 --> 54:12.207
I want to give this to her myself.

54:14.459 --> 54:15.919
Then why did you want to see me?

54:17.087 --> 54:18.964
I'll get straight to the point.

54:19.881 --> 54:20.966
Move out of her house.

54:21.591 --> 54:24.761
Both you and your brother.
You two shouldn't be there.

54:26.388 --> 54:27.222
Why not?

54:30.850 --> 54:32.310
Because that's where I belong.

54:33.353 --> 54:34.521
You can't handle her.

54:34.604 --> 54:36.189
It's not a job for everyone.

54:36.273 --> 54:40.735
I've been enduring everything
and putting up with her for ten years.

54:40.819 --> 54:42.946
I've been bending over backwards for her.

54:43.029 --> 54:46.324
I've been putting my life and soul
on the line to protect her.

54:46.783 --> 54:49.035
Why? What for?

54:50.829 --> 54:53.331
Well, because I truly care about her and--

54:53.415 --> 54:54.416
For money?

54:56.334 --> 55:00.005
You've made quite a bit of money
from selling her books, right?

55:04.884 --> 55:07.804
Why boast about your sacrifices
when you were rewarded for them?

55:07.887 --> 55:10.223
What? I wasn't boasting!

55:10.307 --> 55:12.642
Had I considered her
only as a means to make money,

55:12.726 --> 55:15.895
I would've deserted her
when my company suffered because of her.

55:15.979 --> 55:18.606
Our relationship
isn't just based on monetary gain.

55:18.690 --> 55:20.692
It's much more than that!

55:22.402 --> 55:23.486
What is it, then?

55:25.905 --> 55:27.032
To Mun-yeong,

55:28.241 --> 55:31.619
I'm her publisher, mentor, brother,
and her man!

55:38.918 --> 55:39.753
Anyway,

55:40.837 --> 55:43.757
you're stealing my spot,
so move aside at once.

55:48.553 --> 55:49.804
I don't want to.

55:51.348 --> 55:52.182
What?

55:53.433 --> 55:54.392
I won't move aside.

55:56.603 --> 55:59.564
Doesn't that caregiver
seem like a great guy?

56:00.106 --> 56:02.275
All the other girls seem to think so too.

56:02.359 --> 56:04.694
There are so many girls who are after him.

56:05.195 --> 56:07.989
You have to snatch him soon.

56:08.365 --> 56:10.617
You're my only child.

56:10.825 --> 56:14.037
It's my lifelong wish to see
the two of you married and living happily

56:14.120 --> 56:15.246
before I pass away.

56:15.330 --> 56:17.916
It's not like I'll live forever.

56:17.999 --> 56:19.793
Can't you just do as I say--

56:20.752 --> 56:21.586
Ms. Kang.

56:22.170 --> 56:24.589
The head nurse
would like to speak with you.

56:25.465 --> 56:26.299
With me? Now?

56:26.925 --> 56:28.635
- I'm busy now.
- You have to go now.

56:28.718 --> 56:30.762
Hey, let me finish before you go!

56:40.063 --> 56:41.773
Why isn't she answering her phone?

56:50.615 --> 56:53.368
GANG-TAE

56:56.121 --> 56:57.247
Gang-tae!

56:57.705 --> 56:58.540
Come join us.

57:03.545 --> 57:04.754
Have a seat.

57:07.841 --> 57:08.800
You must be hungry.

57:10.385 --> 57:11.594
Gosh.

57:12.387 --> 57:16.307
Can you even eat proper meals
in that remote place?

57:16.391 --> 57:19.227
I couldn't sleep a wink
because I was so worried.

57:19.477 --> 57:20.311
That's why

57:21.104 --> 57:24.649
I woke up early and made a few things
with the ingredients I had.

57:24.899 --> 57:26.109
Go on and eat up.

57:26.192 --> 57:27.402
Okay, thank you.

57:27.485 --> 57:29.863
- Here. You too, Sang-tae.
- Thank you.

57:31.072 --> 57:31.906
Here, eat up.

57:38.788 --> 57:40.165
- Try this.
- Thank you.

57:42.792 --> 57:43.793
Gosh.

57:44.627 --> 57:46.129
The house feels empty

57:46.546 --> 57:48.923
without you guys.

57:56.931 --> 57:59.267
Well, Ju-ri.

58:00.101 --> 58:04.063
Yes, I heard you have to stay there
for a while because of Sang-tae's work.

58:04.606 --> 58:07.484
Congratulations.
I'd like a copy when your book comes out.

58:07.567 --> 58:10.195
Well, buy your own copy.

58:10.278 --> 58:12.405
You should pay for it with your money.

58:12.489 --> 58:13.323
Sang-tae.

58:14.199 --> 58:16.618
All right. When your book comes out,

58:16.701 --> 58:19.162
- I'll buy 100 copies.
- Thank you.

58:20.455 --> 58:22.207
- Eat up.
- Okay.

58:31.633 --> 58:34.427
My gosh, I knew that nurse would do this.

58:34.969 --> 58:37.388
She's even getting her mom to help her.

58:38.556 --> 58:39.432
Don't just leave.

58:39.516 --> 58:41.809
Make sure
that skank stays away from him!

58:42.977 --> 58:44.270
What did I tell you?

58:44.354 --> 58:45.980
I said other girls will snatch him.

58:46.064 --> 58:48.441
Don't be so stubborn.
Listen to your mom, please!

58:48.858 --> 58:51.903
I've been eyeing him for you,
but that bitch is about to snatch him.

58:51.986 --> 58:54.989
Okay, fine. If you don't want
to do the work, I'll do it for you.

58:55.698 --> 58:57.951
Is she the only one with a mom?
You have one too!

58:58.034 --> 58:59.035
Please!

59:04.207 --> 59:05.041
Please.

59:06.918 --> 59:08.628
Stop saying that word, "mom."

59:10.088 --> 59:12.674
- What do I say, then? I am your mom.
- My mom

59:15.176 --> 59:16.010
is dead.

59:18.846 --> 59:20.014
What?

59:20.765 --> 59:21.975
I said my mom

59:23.977 --> 59:25.144
is dead.

59:27.564 --> 59:28.773
Mom.

59:31.484 --> 59:34.946
Her skull cracked,
so there was blood everywhere.

59:37.073 --> 59:38.825
No. That can't be.

59:38.908 --> 59:40.535
Her limbs were all twisted

59:42.036 --> 59:43.162
and wobbly.

59:43.246 --> 59:45.290
No, it can't be.

59:45.915 --> 59:47.041
The floor

59:49.377 --> 59:51.671
is still stained with her blood.

59:53.131 --> 59:53.965
No.

59:56.593 --> 59:57.510
That can't be.

59:58.928 --> 01:00:00.805
- So ma'am,
- No.

01:00:00.888 --> 01:00:01.723
please

01:00:04.058 --> 01:00:04.892
wake up

01:00:07.478 --> 01:00:08.313
from your dream.

01:00:10.982 --> 01:00:11.816
No...

01:00:12.400 --> 01:00:13.610
No...

01:00:30.460 --> 01:00:32.045
What's on the menu today again?

01:00:32.545 --> 01:00:33.838
Ms. Park!

01:00:35.256 --> 01:00:36.090
Over there.

01:00:36.633 --> 01:00:38.801
- We'll go check. It's okay.
- Okay. My gosh.

01:00:41.638 --> 01:00:42.472
Ms. Kang.

01:00:43.389 --> 01:00:45.433
Ms. Kang.

01:00:45.850 --> 01:00:47.101
Call Dr. Kwon. Hurry!

01:00:47.185 --> 01:00:48.019
Yes, ma'am.

01:00:48.811 --> 01:00:49.687
Ms. Kang.

01:01:07.038 --> 01:01:08.247
You're not going to eat?

01:01:12.877 --> 01:01:14.712
You left your phone at the hospital.

01:01:20.051 --> 01:01:20.885
Are you asleep?

01:02:12.937 --> 01:02:14.063
Is it

01:02:17.608 --> 01:02:18.484
really you?

01:02:19.527 --> 01:02:20.528
You're back?

01:04:16.936 --> 01:04:18.688
You don't seem to be in a good mood.

01:04:20.147 --> 01:04:21.023
Mom.

01:04:22.942 --> 01:04:24.151
Why did Bluebeard

01:04:26.529 --> 01:04:30.283
kill his wives?

01:04:31.450 --> 01:04:34.871
Because they didn't listen to him.

01:04:36.205 --> 01:04:38.457
You have to listen to Mom
at all times, okay?

01:04:38.541 --> 01:04:40.710
That makes you a good girl, right?

01:04:42.628 --> 01:04:43.462
Answer me.

01:04:45.131 --> 01:04:47.550
Yes, I'll listen to you at all times.

01:04:50.303 --> 01:04:51.470
Good.

01:04:52.680 --> 01:04:53.514
Good girl.

01:04:55.224 --> 01:04:57.685
But why did you bring him here?

01:05:40.186 --> 01:05:41.854
I've warned you

01:05:44.315 --> 01:05:47.276
that I will also kill the prince
who comes to save you.

01:05:57.453 --> 01:05:58.454
Ko Mun-yeong.

01:06:01.207 --> 01:06:02.416
Ko Mun-yeong.

01:06:09.131 --> 01:06:09.966
Run.

01:06:10.800 --> 01:06:11.801
Run.

01:06:12.009 --> 01:06:13.636
- It's okay, Ko Mun-yeong.
- Run...

01:06:14.095 --> 01:06:15.471
- Run.
- It was just a dream.

01:06:15.554 --> 01:06:16.639
Please run. Go!

01:06:17.431 --> 01:06:18.808
Get out at once!

01:06:22.520 --> 01:06:23.604
Get lost.

01:06:27.316 --> 01:06:28.317
Leave at once.

01:06:37.326 --> 01:06:39.662
Okay, I won't leave.

01:07:53.444 --> 01:07:56.155
My mother always appears in my nightmares.

01:07:57.656 --> 01:07:58.783
You shouldn't be here.

01:08:00.034 --> 01:08:01.327
What are you doing?

01:08:02.411 --> 01:08:05.664
The body can't lie.
So it cries when it's hurting.

01:08:05.915 --> 01:08:09.668
But the heart is a liar, so it stays
silent even when it is hurting.

01:08:10.753 --> 01:08:12.296
I miss Mom.

01:08:13.839 --> 01:08:15.758
Then what's going on here? Is it a fling?

01:08:16.175 --> 01:08:18.719
- What is this crap?
- A nightmare doll.

01:08:19.428 --> 01:08:20.596
How do I look?

01:08:21.597 --> 01:08:23.182
You did well, Mun-yeong.

01:08:26.018 --> 01:08:26.852
Sang-tae.

01:08:28.395 --> 01:08:30.648
Have you ever heard
the story of Bluebeard?

01:08:33.484 --> 01:08:35.820
BLUEBEARD DRAGGED HIS WIFE
DOWN TO THE BASEMENT

01:09:17.695 --> 01:09:20.030
AND CUT OFF HER HEAD

01:09:48.058 --> 01:09:52.021
AND ONCE AGAIN,
BLUEBEARD WAS ALL ALONE

01:09:52.104 --> 01:09:54.273
BLOOPERS

01:10:45.950 --> 01:10:48.369
Subtitle translation by Liya Choi
